Intel's FreeBSD NVMUpdate utility and NVM images for Intel I225-V and I226
Ethernet controllers.  The utility and license files are fetched directly
from Intel's E610 FreeBSD update package.  The NVM images are fetched from a
pinned commit of an unofficial, unsupported GitHub mirror and are not supplied
or endorsed by Intel through that mirror.

The generated configuration is limited to Intel reference subsystem IDs.  It
uses known ETrack lineages for I225-V and I226-V.  I226-LM and I226-IT entries
omit REPLACES so they match the exact four-part PCI ID regardless of installed
NVM version; separate configurations select each flash-size variant.  The
generated configuration is not supplied, approved, or supported by Intel.
